Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 19:54:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 056/128] feat: send scheduled messages on time

A local timer fires server-scheduled messages at the set minute while the app is online.

Constraint: Reuses stock sendScheduledMessages request, no custom send path

Constraint: Only server-scheduled (positive mid) non-encrypted dialogs

Rejected: Client-side scheduling of unsent messages | stock retry path already covers offline sends

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Wall-clock delivery on device
